{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名隨團前往日本旅遊的30多歲台灣女子，今晨（19日）被揭陳屍山梨縣富士河口湖町一間酒店內。</p><p>當地警方已拘捕現場一名持刀的27歲台籍女子，正調查兩人關係及死者死因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:41:25.790557+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:37:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T16:57:39.211686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:05.911887+00:00","content_hash":"7d9c878efb7d74c164164b345aefa08a76cd1e36155f9ead3b623e58898e8d9a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}